    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0290" n="174" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg174"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/650.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-11-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 10, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Asylum at the Legation has been asked by the Emperor and Empress Dowager, which I
                    strongly urge be granted.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
